Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.14,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,111)\fs90}Tripman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.14,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs29\)\pos(322,571)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.77,0:00:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am off to school!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were the one who bumped into me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were late?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you woke up earlier, you wouldn't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have made it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:01:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say, If I wasn’t being pushed down by Giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've been able to make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are helpless, let's try this Tripman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.21,0:01:13.13,Pun,,0,0,0,,{\pos(372,488)}Koroshiya
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.21,0:01:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(372,538)}A hitman?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not professional killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I said he's not hitman....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but rather he's a Tripman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:33.48,Pun,,0,0,0,,{\pos(516,496)\fs36}Korubashiya
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! I was scared for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's a Tripman, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Like his name suggests, he wrestles people and knocks them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}10 into the opening in its' back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And call a name of someone, whom you hate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It may sound boring...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's great gadget for payback to Giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll hire Tripman with {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}10.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give Giant a hard time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He will trip Giant 3 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.19,0:02:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see him in action!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He walks like an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he knows where Giant is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you little punk, trying to give me a hard time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know your place! I'll tear you into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He is quite a pro, alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He is bloodless and tearless wrestler!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.78,0:03:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, from now on, I am going to use this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to teach a lesson to those people who are trying to give me a hard time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to me? Just watch me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you my Tripman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call my name now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Cop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Cop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, I outran the Tripman at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, why are you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a hard time. Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Tripman gets a request, he'll be sure to see through the request.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! What am I supposed to do now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Put {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}100 in and he will reject the request.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding! I have spent {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}20 already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have no other choice but to be trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, I have {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}100.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go cancel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't tear my house down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cancel the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe for you to come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have canceled the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}120, what a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I canceled it, but why did you trip down?